  "notes": "A formal word commonly used in business, technical, and academic contexts. Often used in the pattern {制約|せいやく}の{中|なか}で (within constraints) or {制約|せいやく}を{受|う}ける (to be subject to restrictions).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {時間|じかん}の{制約|せいやく}: time constraint\n- {予算|よさん}の{制約|せいやく}: budget constraint\n- {制約|せいやく}を{受|う}ける: to be subject to restrictions\n- {制約|せいやく}{条件|じょうけん}: limiting conditions",
